__['This website allows you to search through items listed for sale in Shop Forums as well as those listed using Public Premium Stash Tabs in-game.'] = '在此页面上，你可以搜索到游戏内市集上架的物品。 确保物品可以被搜到，你需要确定物品所在市集页是未过期状态。';
__['You can search by an item\'s name or an item\'s base type using the "Search Items" field.'] = '你可以通过 "查找物品"来搜索一个物品的名称或者基础类型。';
__['Players will have their Online/Offline status updated approximately every 5 minutes.'] = '玩家的在线/离线状态大约每 5 分钟更新一次。';
__['While searching is easy, you will still have to contact the player selling the item in order to complete the trade.'] = '在完成搜索后，你需要在游戏内联系玩家，或者到游戏市集搜索此物品， 最终在游戏内完成交易。';
__['The easiest way to contact a player is to use the "Direct Whisper" feature. It requires that both you and the seller are online and in-game to use.'] = '与玩家取得联系的最简单的方式是使用"直接私聊"功能，这需要你和卖家同时在线，才能在游戏中使用。';
__['Please note: The whisper message will be translated into the seller\'s local language.'] = '注意：私聊内容将自动转化为卖家本地语言显示 ';
__['If for any reason you no longer wish to view a certain player\'s listings, you can use the "Ignore Player" button to remove their listings from your search results.'] = '如果不希望查看某个玩家的上架物品，可以使用"忽略玩家"按钮来将 其上架的物品从搜索列表中移除 ';
__['Please note: This feature requires you to be logged in with your Path of Exile account. Additionally, this ignore list is not tied to your in-game ignore list in any way, and may be managed in the settings panel right here on the trade site.'] = '注意：在使用私信沟通时， 需要登录游戏帐号，以便沟通。 另外，页面市集的忽略名单与游戏内的忽略名单无关， 页面市集的忽略名单可以在页面上单独设置。 ';
__['We also allow you to perform a "Live Search" where you will be notified when a new item matching your search criteria is listed or updated.'] = '同时，在有一个符合搜索条件的新物品上架或者更新时， 可以使用 "实时搜索"来获得新物品提醒';
__['Please note: The search only runs while you keep your browser tab or window open (in the background is okay).'] = '注意：搜索只可运行于浏览器和窗口开启时(可在后台运行).';
__['Settings'] = '设定';
__['About'] = '关于';
__['When logged into this site, you may also choose how your in-game status is used for trade-related searches.'] = '在登录市集页面时，可以设置游戏内状态， 此状态可以用作交易相关的搜索。';
__['By default, your status will show for items you have listed in the league that you are currently playing in.'] = '默认情况下， 当前角色正在游戏的区内物品会显示当前的在线状态。 ';
__['You may opt to show your status regardless of what league you are playing if you so choose.'] = '你也可以选择不仅在游戏所在区内显示状态。 ';
__['Please note: Players using the Do Not Disturb feature in-game will be treated as Offline for the purposes of this site.'] = '注意：如果游戏内设置了免打扰，那么在市集页面上将被视作离线。 ';
__['Bulk Item Exchange'] = '散货交换';
__['Certain items may be listed for bulk sale (listed below).'] = '某些物品会以批量形式上架（如下）';
__['Your eligible items will be grouped together under one price, with the total amount of items presented as "stock".'] = '符合条件的物品会以同一价格组合到一起， 所有物品以 "库存"的形式展示。';
__['In order to list exchange entries, either in-game or on the forum, use the ratio format on the item you wish to offer for the type of item you would like in return.'] = '为了展示交易项，在游戏和页面上，使用交易比例的格式来展示希望出售和获得的物品';
__['For example:'] = '例如:';
__['will list your intent to buy 3 Orbs of Fusing for 1 Chaos Orb each.'] = '表示希望3个点金石，价格为每个1混沌石';
__['Alternatively:'] = '或者';
__['will list your intent to buy 2 Orbs of Chaos for 35 Chromatic Orbs each. This is technically equivalent to selling 17.5 Chromatic Orbs per Chaos Orb, however pricing this way is more appropriate for bulk sets of items.'] = '表示希望购买2个混沌石，价格为每个35幻色石， 理论上,这个等于每个混沌石17.5幻色石的价格。 这种出价方式更加适合批量物品。';
__['Please note: Stock includes all of the items of that type that are publicly listed (priced or not).'] = '注意：仓库包含所有公开的物品 (包括标价及未标价物品).';
