__['You have been muted for {TIME} for breaching our Code of Conduct. If you have any questions about our in game chat rules, or anything else, please contact support@grindinggear.com'] = '由于你违反了我们的行为准则，你被禁言{TIME}。如果你对我们的游戏聊天规则有任何疑问，或有任何其他问题，请访问腾讯游戏安全中心 https://gamesafe.qq.com/';
__['You have been muted permanently for breaching our Code of Conduct. If you have any questions about our in game chat rules, or anything else, please contact support@grindinggear.com'] = '由于你违反了我们的行为准则，你已被永久禁言。如果你对我们的游戏聊天规则有任何疑问，或有任何其他问题，请访问腾讯游戏安全中心 https://gamesafe.qq.com/';
__['You have been muted for {TIME} due to the following statement "{MESSAGE}" as this breaches our Code of Conduct. If you have any questions about our in game chat rules, or anything else, please contact support@grindinggear.com'] = '由于你的以下言论"{MESSAGE}"违反了我们的行为准则，你已被禁言{TIME}。如果你对我们的游戏聊天规则有任何疑问，或有任何其他问题，请联系support@grindinggear.com';
__['You have been muted permanently due to the following statement "{MESSAGE}" as this breaches our Code of Conduct. If you have any questions about our in game chat rules, or anything else, please contact support@grindinggear.com'] = '由于你的以下言论"{MESSAGE}"违反了我们的行为准则，你已被永久禁言。如果你对我们的游戏聊天规则有任何疑问，或有任何其他问题，请访问腾讯游戏安全中心 https://gamesafe.qq.com/';
__['You have been muted for {TIME} for trading in the global chat. For future trading, please use the dedicated trade channels. If you have any questions about our in game chat rules, or anything else, please contact support@grindinggear.com'] = '你已被禁止在世界聊天频道发布交易信息，持续{TIME}。对于未来的交易，请使用专用交易频道。如果你对我们的游戏聊天规则有任何疑问，或有任何其他问题，请访问腾讯游戏安全中心 https://gamesafe.qq.com';
__['You have been muted permanently for trading in the global chat. For future trading, please use the dedicated trade channels. If you have any questions about our in game chat rules, or anything else, please contact support@grindinggear.com'] = '你已被永久禁止在世界聊天频道发布交易信息。对于未来的交易，请使用专用交易频道。如果你对我们的游戏聊天规则有任何疑问，或有任何其他问题，请访问腾讯游戏安全中心 https://gamesafe.qq.com';
__['Your character will be renamed shortly for breaching our Code of Conduct. This will log you out of the game client. When you log back in you will need to select a new character name. If you have any questions about our in game chat rules, or anything else, please contact support@grindinggear.com'] = '因你违反了我们的行为准则，你的角色将被暂时重命名。这将使你退出游戏客户端。重新登录时，你需要选择一个新的角色名。如果你对我们的游戏聊天规则有任何疑问，或有任何其他问题，请访问腾讯游戏安全中心 https://gamesafe.qq.com';
