__['You have attempted to export your data too many times. If your download did not begin, please contact {SUPPORT_LINK} for assistance'] = '尝试导出数据次数过多。如未开始下载，请联系{SUPPORT_LINK}获取帮助';
__['Your export is being prepared and the download will begin shortly. If it does not begin within the next 30 seconds, {LINK}click here{/LINK} to try again.'] = '导出已准备就绪，即将开始下载。如30秒内仍未开始，{LINK}请点击此处{/LINK}重试。';
__['You may download a copy of all data that is tracked against your account by pressing the button below. If you would like to remove this information, you may delete your account. 30 days after your account is deleted, the information will be removed.'] = '按下方按钮即可下载源自您账户的所有数据的副本。如想删除此信息，需要删除您的账号。删除账号30天后，该信息就会被删除。';
__['You may only periodically download your data. Please contact us at {SUPPORT_LINK} if you would like to download your account data.'] = '您只能定期下载您的数据。如想下载您的账号信息，请访问{SUPPORT_LINK}与我们联系。';
__['Delete your account'] = '删除您的账号';
__['{BOLD}CAUTION{/BOLD}: After deleting your account, there is a 30 day window in which it can be recovered. After this time lapses, it will be impossible for us to recover your account.'] = '{BOLD}注意{/BOLD}：删除您的账号后，会有一个为期30天的窗口时间，您可以在此期间恢复账号。这段时间过后，我们无法再恢复您的账号。';
__['When you complete the deletion process below, you will be logged out and your account will immediately be deleted. After 30 days, all your data will be permanently removed. If you change your mind within 30 days and wish to recover your account, please contact us at {SUPPORT_LINK} for assistance with this.'] = '完成如下所示的删除过程后，您将被注销，您的账号也将被立即删除。30天后，您的所有数据都将被永久删除。如果您在30天内改变主意，想恢复您的账号，请访问{SUPPORT_LINK}与我们联系，我们会为您提供帮助。';
__['To delete your account, type your account name into the field and click "{BUTTON}".'] = '要想删除您的账号，请输入您的账号名称，点击"{BUTTON}"。';
