__['Crucible Update'] = '古神熔炉更新';
__['Crucible Passive Trees'] = '熔炉天赋树';
__['For the purposes of search filters, all items with Crucible Passive Trees are considered unallocated. The allocated effects will still be represented visually on the item.'] = '为了方便过滤器的搜索，所有具有熔炉天赋树的物品都会被视作未分配。已分配的效果依然会显示在物品上。';
__['You can hover over the tree preview to view each node, and expand or collapse each preview\'s size individually by dragging the handle in the bottom-right corner.'] = '你可以悬停在天赋树上查看各个节点，也可以拖动右下角的把手，展开或折叠预览大小。';
__['To find items with your preferred Crucible Passive Tree skills, use the "Crucible Passive Tree Path" stat group. This group will match trees with a valid path that includes all of the selected skills. The "min" field in this stat group can be used to partially match a subset of the selected skills instead. Multiple "Crucible Passive Tree Path" groups will be applied together for each path.'] = '要寻找具有你偏好的熔炉天赋树的物品，可以使用"熔炉天赋树路径"状态组。该组会搜索有效路径中包含所有已选中天赋的天赋树。使用该状态组中的"最小值"可以对所选的天赋子集进行模糊匹配。每一条路线会共同运用多个"熔炉天赋树路径"状态组。';
__['Crucible skills can also be used in And, Not, If, and Count stat groups for basic matching. They are not supported in the Weighted Sum stat group.'] = '与、非、如果和数量等状态组也可以使用熔炉天赋，以进行基础匹配。但加权求和数据组中并不支持。';
__['Other changes'] = '其他改动';
__['Added Anomalous, Divergent, and Phantasmal gems to the "Search Items" drop-down.'] = '在"搜索物品"下拉菜单中新增了异常、分歧和魅影宝石。';
__['Updated the Bulk Exchange to include Crucible items.'] = '更新了批量兑换，使其包含古神熔炉物品。';
__['Fixed a bug where Blood-filled Vessels weren\'t searchable by area level.'] = '修正了无法按照区域等级搜索浸血法器的问题。';
