__['Match items that meet each stat\'s `min` and `max` requirements if the stat is present.'] = '若存在改属性，匹配满足各项属性的`最小值`和`最大值`要求的物品。';
__['Count each stat that meets the `min` and `max` (if provided, otherwise existence) requirements.\nUse the group\'s `min` and `max` to filter items based on the count of matching stats.'] = '计算各项满足`最小值`和`最大值`要求（如有，否则仅计算存在该属性）的属性\n使用该组的`最小值`和`最大值`，根据匹配属性的数量对物品进行筛选。';
__['Check each stat meets the `min` and `max` (if provided, otherwise existence) requirements before multiplying the stat value by the `weight` and finally summing them together.\nUse the group\'s `min` and `max` to filter items based on the total summed value.'] = '检查各项属性是否满足`最小值`和`最大值`要求（如有，否则仅计算存在该属性），随后将属性值乘以`权重`并最终加总。\n使用该组的`最小值`和`最大值`，根据加总值对物品进行筛选。';
__['Each stat value that meets the `min` and `max` (if provided, otherwise existence) requirements will be multiplied by the `weight` before being summed together.\nUse the group\'s `min` and `max` to filter items based on the total summed value.'] = '各项满足`最小值`和`最大值`要求（如有，否则仅计算存在该属性）的属性将会乘以`权重`并最终加总。\n使用该组的`最小值`和`最大值`，根据加总值对物品进行筛选。';
